msgstr "<b>System performance</b> — What falcond applies while a game runs: performance mode, the sched-ext scheduler for games without one of their own, 3D V-Cache, and falcond's own settings."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/tutorial.rs:92
